# main-tema-vision-usbd: the same main screen as main-tema-vision-cwr with the
# mode in USB-D. It is the VISION fixture that makes the top bar's mode cell
# measurably overflow: `USB-D` (5 characters) is the widest mode the radio lists
# (`mode_names[]`, src/remote_server.cpp) and, once fonts_scale() widens it to
# sony_26, its label measures 66 px in the fixed 56 px cell of the top bar, so the
# WRAP label grows past the box the cell clips (`typography_text_overflow`). The
# 4-character modes sit at the cell's edge instead of crossing it: `CW-R` measures
# 56 px, exactly the cell width (0 px of margin, which is the `CW-RAUTO` pegging of
# issue #28 in main-tema-vision-cwr), so it does not wrap and the contract cannot
# fire on it. Same radio state as home-usb-20m apart from the mode.

name main-tema-vision-usbd
screen main

theme VISION
seed 20

frequency_hz 14074000
tx_frequency_hz 14074000
fft_width_hz 384000

mode USB-D
vfo A
agc auto

split false
att false
pre false
atu false
ant 1

smeter_db -73

battery_v 12.1
external_v 13.8
battery_cap 76
charging false

rxtx rx
